From d2f0d3a5955bb1075858a5b9ce4b68d443126b66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy J Fontaine <tjfontaine@atxconsulting.com>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 21:34:07 -0700
Subject: bifrost: tidy driver comments and re-pin the wire-format hash

Editorial pass over the driver comments: name capabilities and
protocol stages by what they do rather than by internal milestone
labels, and update the CANONICAL_SHA256 pin in the vendored wire.rs
to track the canonical host/bifrost-wire source.
